     possible symbol index values.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEESS
     On success, these functions return the created attribute descriptor.  In
     case of an error, these functions return DW_DLV_BADADDR and sets the ar‐
     gument _e_r_r.

EERRRROORRSS
     These functions can fail with:

     [DW_DLE_ARGUMENT]  Either of the arguments _d_b_g or _d_i_e was NULL.

     [DW_DLE_MEMORY]    An out of memory condition was encountered during exe‐
                        cution.

